graph TD
    %% 定义样式
    classDef core fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef memory fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef network fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef wireless fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef interface fill:#ddd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;

    subgraph 核心处理与存储
        CPU[CPU: MT7986A<br>四核A53 2.0GHz<br>集成2.4G/5G基带与MAC]:::core
        RAM[内存: M15T4G16256A<br>容量: 512MB]:::memory
        Flash[闪存: F50L1G41LB<br>容量: 128MB]:::memory
    end

    subgraph 有线网络部分
        PHY1[2.5G PHY芯片 1<br>RTL8221B]:::network
        Switch[千兆交换芯片<br>MT7531A]:::network
        PHY2[2.5G PHY芯片 2<br>RTL8221B]:::network
    end

    subgraph 无线射频部分
        RF5G[5G RF射频芯片<br>MT7976AN]:::wireless
        FEM5G[4颗 5G FEM<br>QPF4588]:::wireless
        
        RF24G[2.4G RF射频芯片<br>MT7976GN]:::wireless
        FEM24G[4颗 2.4G FEM<br>丝印: 3321 82d M009]:::wireless
        
        Antenna((8根外置天线)):::interface
    end
    
    subgraph 外围接口
        Port25G_1(2.5G 网口 1):::interface
        Port25G_2(2.5G 网口 2):::interface
        Ports1G(4个 千兆网口):::interface
        USB(USB 3.0 接口<br>带屏蔽罩):::interface
    end

    %% 连接关系 - 存储
    CPU <--> RAM
    CPU <--> Flash
    
    %% 连接关系 - 有线网络 (已修正)
    CPU <-->|SGMII 总线| PHY1
    CPU <-->|SGMII 总线| Switch
    Switch <-->|SGMII 总线| PHY2
    
    PHY1 <--> Port25G_1
    PHY2 <--> Port25G_2
    Switch <--> Ports1G
    
    %% 连接关系 - 无线射频
    CPU <--> RF5G
    CPU <--> RF24G
    
    RF5G <--> FEM5G
    RF24G <--> FEM24G
    
    FEM5G <--> Antenna
    FEM24G <--> Antenna
    
    %% 连接关系 - USB
    CPU <--> USB